      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然因为这少见的气势而有些慌张，\n但没什么大不了的。\n只是年糕吃多了而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ebe485c8655f928022b3fa732c8ccf418d0c624aaa7572db4c2418563d30f49",
